  "item_short_desc": "<p>Embrace winter with Rothco&rsquo;s Acrylic Watch Cap, designed for optimal warmth and comfort. The double-layer acrylic construction ensures your head stays warm and dry in cold weather. Lightweight and allergy-friendly, the acrylic fabric retains shape, color, and warmth. Perfect for various outdoor activities like shoveling snow or raking leaves during fall and winter. One size fits most, and proudly made in the USA, this watch cap is a versatile and essential accessory for cold-weather wear.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
